      }
    ]
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "marian.epilogue.node.direction.001",
      "command": {
        "type": "background",
        "assetId": "marian.epilogue.asset.background.001",
        "transition": "dissolve"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "marian.epilogue.node.line.001a",
      "lineId": "marian.epilogue.line.001a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "最終大会のあと、新しい救護室に、月に一度の特別な札が掛かるようになった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "marian.epilogue.node.line.001b",
      "lineId": "marian.epilogue.line.001b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「本日——第一回・治さない相談日。治療は、緊急の方のみ。それ以外は、お話を伺います」"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "marian.epilogue.node.direction.002",
      "command": {
        "type": "still",
        "assetId": "marian.epilogue.asset.still.001"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "marian.epilogue.node.line.002a",
      "lineId": "marian.epilogue.line.002a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "初日は、盛況だった。癖毛のおじいさんは奥さんの話をしに来た。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "marian.epilogue.node.line.002b",
      "lineId": "marian.epilogue.line.002b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "膝の古傷の元選手は「これは勲章だから治すな」と自慢しに来た。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "marian.epilogue.node.line.002c",
      "lineId": "marian.epilogue.line.002c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "受付票の束が、治療記録でなく、思い出の記録で埋まっていく。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "marian.epilogue.node.line.003a",
      "lineId": "marian.epilogue.line.003a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "受付票の綴りの一番奥には、今も一枚だけ、死者用の受付票がある。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "marian.epilogue.node.line.003b",
      "lineId": "marian.epilogue.line.003b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "空のベッドの人の分。彼女はそれを、隠さなくなった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "marian.epilogue.node.line.003c",
      "lineId": "marian.epilogue.line.003c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「間に合わなかった一人も、私の患者名簿にいます。……いていいと、思えるようになったので」",
      "emotion": "revelation"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "marian.epilogue.node.line.004a",
      "lineId": "marian.epilogue.line.004a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.quc8xa",
      "speakerName": "マリアン",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "本日、最後の相談者の方。……どうぞ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "marian.epilogue.node.line.005a",
      "lineId": "marian.epilogue.line.005a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "閉室間際、その日、最後の相談者は、私だった。相談内容は、大したことじゃない。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "marian.epilogue.node.line.005b",
      "lineId": "marian.epilogue.line.005b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "今週の疲れの話と、来週の楽しみの話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "marian.epilogue.node.line.005c",
      "lineId": "marian.epilogue.line.005c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "彼女は治さず、脈も測らず、ただ聞いて、時々「痛かったですね」と言った。満点の相槌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "marian.epilogue.node.line.005d",
      "lineId": "marian.epilogue.line.005d",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "師匠は私だが、もう抜かれている。耳が、ちょっとだけ、悔しそうに、動いた気がした。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "marian.epilogue.node.line.006a",
      "lineId": "marian.epilogue.line.006a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "相談の締めに、私は、例のものをそっと出した。お土産のクッキー。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "marian.epilogue.node.line.006b",
      "lineId": "marian.epilogue.line.006b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "今度のは、割れていない、綺麗な一枚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "marian.epilogue.node.line.007a",
      "lineId": "marian.epilogue.line.007a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.quc8xa",
      "speakerName": "マリアン",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "……割りましょう。半分こに。今日の私は、治さない日なので——不揃いでも、直しません。"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "marian.epilogue.node.direction.003",
      "command": {
        "type": "still",
        "assetId": "marian.epilogue.asset.still.002"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "marian.epilogue.node.direction.004",
      "command": {
        "type": "effect",
        "effectId": "pulse"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "marian.epilogue.node.line.008a",
      "lineId": "marian.epilogue.line.008a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "ぱき、と乾いた音。クッキーは、見事に不揃いな二片に割れた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "marian.epilogue.node.line.008b",
      "lineId": "marian.epilogue.line.008b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "大きい方が、そっと私の手に押しつけられる。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "marian.epilogue.node.line.008c",
      "lineId": "marian.epilogue.line.008c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "金糸の治癒陣は編まれず、割れ目のまま、二杯のお茶の隣に。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "marian.epilogue.node.line.009a",
      "lineId": "marian.epilogue.line.009a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.quc8xa",
      "speakerName": "マリアン",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "柿落としの出演届、出しました。演目「救護席は舞台袖に」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "marian.epilogue.node.line.009b",
      "lineId": "marian.epilogue.line.009b",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.quc8xa",
      "speakerName": "マリアン",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "……出番がないことが、演目です。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "marian.epilogue.node.line.009c",
      "lineId": "marian.epilogue.line.009c",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.quc8xa",
      "speakerName": "マリアン",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "私の腕の見せ所は、誰も倒れない一日を、舞台袖から見届けることなので。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "marian.epilogue.node.line.010a",
      "lineId": "marian.epilogue.line.010a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "良い予定だと思う。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "end",
      "id": "marian.epilogue.node.end.001",
      "mode": "return-to-week"
    }
  ],
